title Simplest Food Macro Tracker

component macro-webapp as "Macro Tracker Web App" web-application
component macro-api as "Macro Tracker API" service
component macro-db as "Macro Tracker DB" database

east user-auth as "Thunder Auth" identity-server

north -> macro-webapp
north -> macro-api

macro-webapp -> macro-api
macro-webapp -> user-auth
macro-api -> user-auth
macro-api -> macro-db
